{"id": "1537722145956962304", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "939547142090018816", "author_name": "snorlax01", "content": "- GLotan \n- Aigis \n- Saya \n- Flex \n\n- Lex Volis: Long Blade \n- Lex Genis: Short Blade \n- Lex Nous: Decomposition \n\n- Vitality - drop Symptoms (up to 3 times) at Rest Spots\n- Gluttony - sacrifice Orisons to raise maximum Health (can be done twice)", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T07:18:49.092000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["600405728892551169"], "reactions": [{"emoji": "❤️", "emoji_id": null, "count": 2}], "reply_to": "1537719553759387648"}
{"id": "1537723201335992400", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "939547142090018816", "author_name": "snorlax01", "content": "Game Plan\n\n- Whenever possible (or when the Orison is not useful) drop the Orison to raise your maximum Health\n- Pick up Symptoms and raise maximum Health from Red Pools, then drop them at Rest Spots\n- Play Short Blade with Genis Orison to obtain additional Copies, to more easily Play and unlock Exalt\n- L also transforms to Deadly Duels, which you can then use to funnel Aliemus into GLotan for her Exalt, as well as raise its Damage\n- Play Long Blade with Volis in an attempt to raise your Damage Output or Draw into Deadly Duels\n- Play Decomposition with Nous on a Target that has Vulnerable for additional Draw Power", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T07:23:00.714000+00:00"}
